<title>UK: TABLE-Meyer Intl yr profit beats forecasts.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Meyer Intl yr profit beats forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.3		   vs 19.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.8		    vs 7.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.0		   vs 11.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     45.4		   vs 37.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,139.7		vs 1,224.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 42.0 and 43.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Year-ago results exclude exceptional charges of 21.1 million stg and 15.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Meyer International Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
